@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<section class="app-page">
    <div class="page-heading">
        <p class="landing-eyebrow">About ReLoop</p>
        <h1>Closing the loop between households, collectors, and verified recycling impact.</h1>
        <p>ReLoop helps people classify waste, schedule collection, record verified diversion, and turn responsible recycling into measurable rewards.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
        <article class="panel">
            <h2>Our mission</h2>
            <p>Make recycling simpler for households and easier to track for collection partners, schools, businesses, and municipalities.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="panel">
            <h2>How it works</h2>
            <p>Users scan items, save classification results, book pickups, and receive reward points once collection records are verified.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="panel">
            <h2>Impact model</h2>
            <p>Every pickup and scan contributes to a circular ledger that reports diverted weight, material type, and reward activity.</p>
        </article>
    </div>

    <section class="panel about-band">
        <h2>Built for circular operations</h2>
        <p>The platform includes member and administrator workflows backed by Firebase Authentication and a shared Firestore data model for the website and mobile app.</p>
        <a class="reloop-btn reloop-btn--primary" asp-page="/Contact">Contact the team</a>
    </section>

    <section class="about-values">
        <div><span>01</span><h2>Clarity</h2><p>Useful guidance for the decisions people make at home.</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><h2>Verification</h2><p>Visible records for every scan and collection.</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><h2>Momentum</h2><p>Rewards that make circular habits easier to keep.</p></div>
    </section>
</section>
